5,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"Since it's the first day, we don't have any information yet. Let's try to get a feel for everyone's behavior. Does anyone have any initial thoughts or strategies they want to share?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't really have a strategy. I'm just a bit nervous. I think we should all just be honest and try to find the werewolf together.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Honesty is a good starting point, but remember that the Werewolf and the Possessed have a reason to lie. We should focus on inconsistencies in our statements as the days progress.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree with Asuka. Logic and consistency are our best tools here. Since we have no data yet, I'll be observing how everyone reacts to the pressure of the coming days.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with everyone. It's a bit nerve-wracking, isn't it? Let's try to keep a positive atmosphere while we work together. I'll do my best to support you all and help us find the truth.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"It seems we are all in agreement on the basic approach. Since we're just observing for now, I'll be paying attention to who tries to steer the conversation or who seems overly hesitant. Does anyone have a specific person they're curious about?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm not sure. Everyone seems so calm, and I don't want to accuse anyone without a reason. Maybe we should just... keep talking and see if anyone says something strange?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, your caution is understandable, but being too passive can be a disadvantage. We need to actively probe for reactions. For now, I'll be analyzing the patterns of our dialogue to see if anyone is mimicking others.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, analyzing patterns is a sound approach. I'm curious if anyone will try to claim a role prematurely to gain trust. For now, I'll continue to monitor the flow of the conversation.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I think it's important to be careful not to put too much pressure on anyone, especially Daisuke. Let's just keep chatting naturally for now. I'm curious to see how we'll all feel tomorrow.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Midori, I appreciate your kindness, but we must remember the stakes. While we keep it natural, we shouldn't let comfort blind us. I'll continue to observe everyone's tone and how they respond to Asuka's logic.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I understand what you mean, Misaki. I'll try my best to be more active. I just... I really hope we can find the werewolf without hurting anyone who's innocent.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, that is an ideal, but unfortunately, the rules of this game make mistakes inevitable. We must prioritize the village's victory over individual comfort. I will continue to observe everyone's reactions to this reality.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, you're correct. Emotional attachments can cloud judgment. The most efficient way to protect the innocent is to ensure the werewolf is identified through rigorous reasoning. I'll be looking for any attempts to deflect logic with emotion.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I understand your points, Ryuji and Asuka. While logic is essential, I believe that trusting one another can also be a strength. Let's just try to stay calm and supportive as we move forward.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"Since we've reached the end of the first day, let's keep these observations in mind. I'll be watching for any shifts in behavior tomorrow once the first night's results are in. Good luck to everyone.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll do my best to remember everything. I hope everyone has a safe night.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I will be processing the information gathered today and preparing for the results of the first divination. Let's see who reveals themselves tomorrow.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I'll be doing the same. I'll analyze the dialogue patterns from today to establish a baseline for everyone's behavior. I look forward to seeing how the dynamics shift tomorrow.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Midori,,"I'll be thinking of you all tonight. Let's hope for a peaceful night and that we can find a way to work together effectively tomorrow. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
